  "identifier": "snomed-ct-mcp",
  "name": "MCP SNOMED CT",
  "description": "Experimental MCP server exposing SNOMED CT concept lookup to LLM agents via any FHIR R4 terminology server. Enables AI agents to resolve clinical terms, retrieve concept hierarchies, and query descriptions without hardcoding terminology endpoints. Works with public FHIR R4 terminology servers (e.g. SNOMED International browser API) as well as self-hosted instances.",
