  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Early-stage MCP server (February 2026) filling a clear gap: SNOMED CT concept lookup for LLM agents via any FHIR R4 terminology server. Apache-2.0, vendor-neutral design is the key differentiator. 18 stars reflects its novelty rather than quality — SNOMED CT access is a fundamental need for clinical AI agents. Explicitly experimental; individual-governed with no institutional backing. Assess with the caveat that API stability, error handling, and production hardening have not been validated. Worth tracking as the MCP ecosystem matures.",
